      "content": "i get that, but my doctor was super rushed and didnt really explain what \"adverse reactions\" means. i just dont want to fail my diet. is it really that big of a deal if i just have a little bit of the cheese or some soy sauce in my cooking? i feel like i can manage it if i just don't eat too much at once. turn it into a \"moderation\" thing?",
