      "content": "that sounds pretty scary. i'm a bit nervous now. since i can't really get back to my doctor until next week, can you help me out with a list of what IS safe? like, if i'm doing high protein, what are some good things i can buy at the store that won't cause those blood pressure issues? maybe some specific meats or cheeses that are fine?",
